aytime_at_review": 7004, "last_played": 1787071243, "avatar": "f48d0711ce228462c670087a4500e8ce791713d8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "产量太低，游戏同质化严重", "timestamp_created": 1748721828, "timestamp_updated": 1748721828, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497076034545898438", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196099185", "author": {"steamid": "76561199044285433", "personaname": "z1T", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199044285433/", "num_games_owned": 161, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 14115, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 121, "playtime_at_review": 9880, "last_played": 1787940186, "avatar": "d2f70d72329f6f8011a215093c73804792f6b1e0"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "私募的优化加上思慕的bug", "timestamp_created": 1748721508, "timestamp_updated": 1757082175, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.532908737659454346", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196098689", "author": {"steamid": "76561199030603070", "personaname": "用户名不可为空", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199030603070/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 17384, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1782, "playtime_at_review": 8437, "last_played": 1788009001, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "仔细想想还是给了差评，游戏可玩性不错，但运营是脑瘫，这意味着只要他们想那就能无下限的恶心你，看个人的接受度了。游戏内指引很少，很多内容你得自己摸索或者找攻略。游戏内bug不能说少，良性恶性都有，另外许多武器装备也要求长时间游玩来换取货币解锁，我个人是不喜欢这种的。\n\n自从前段时间的某次更新后就会出现进任务或者任务结算时电脑直接黑屏关机，查了系统日志，排除了硬件和系统的问题，最后确定是游戏本身出了问题，具体是八字不合还是怎么着就不清楚了，等后续更新再试试吧。\n\n#后续为追加评价\n我仍然选择给这款游戏一个差评，但也不得不承认它玩起来很上瘾。糟糕的武器平衡和暗改削弱、同样糟糕且稀少的优化、相当不利于玩家游戏体验却死活不修的bug、离谱的敌人强度还有臃肿的游戏体积（PC端游戏大小远高于PS端，多出来的部分是无用的废物，例如重复的材质纹理，详情可自行搜索）都使这款游戏玩起来很是别扭。然而该死的是我的确很喜欢与其他玩家合作在不同环境、地貌中与各种敌人战斗的体验，并且可以接受这款游戏的种种缺点。\n\n对于正在犹豫是否该入手这款游戏，并且看到了这条评论的人，我想劝你一句：多去搜搜有关这款游戏的信息，尤其是负面消息，例如新增的bug、对玩家不利的暗改等等，总之就是尽可能的拉低你对这款游戏的期待，然后思考：这款游戏是否真的值得你投入金钱和时间？我个人认为，一款游戏是否适合你，取决于你能否接受它的缺点，而不是它的优点有多么吸引你。\n\n最后，如果你是因为这款游戏正在打折，以至于你不在乎买它所花的那点钱，那其实可以买一个玩玩，不喜欢再卸掉，等待箭头有朝一日终于意识到自己该干点正事（虽然可能性不大），开始大刀阔斧的改善玩家游玩体验时再回来，毕竟这游戏出来时间也不长，我估摸着一两年死不了的，再给点时间也未尝不可。", "timestamp_created": 1748721095, "timestamp_updated": 1763685407, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.55609363317489624", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196097624", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160397175", "personaname": "garlicball", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198160397175/", "num_games_owned": 263, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 976, "last_played": 1748796165, "avatar": "10a7d24c024dfd234c74b8c878fa70c942f1a099"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "sb", "timestamp_created": 1748720197, "timestamp_updated": 1748720197, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51754385232925415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196096768", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017711447", "personaname": "月圈圈", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017711447/", "nu